      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033b02970e76a4b6086692d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2006eb90c4483cd2444ac5e7378edb673044470d41a5dd967aaabbc498929a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8025d1790388ee6f8e638734",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青酱～！小圣王～！\n要开始准备演唱会咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1778861a81c906ae47295acd29d063113f626bb9ebc489c965f309829d07cfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bc4939b5baa9ef6f590815d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青云天空",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded35a7f69bae7ffc26786ffbea2aa51ca63558d569a98da0b4725e8da7c5f8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133fd25ccb2b8bd63a7fc3ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，看来时间差不多了哦？\n该怎么办，圣王？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da2325bd82faa0fb86e6a7c580dc4b09bc110de6b747df8c039dbe3a959cc017",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24687a1cf84ac4e6d2b575d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・伴随着感谢及誓言",
      "source_fingerprint": "233117243de24615a3659d1553cd291cc4a32d0971807efa2611207345af8bf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f063c6ee489d9834fb595654",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千金小姐圣王光环，其母为赛马娘界的传说，\n本身也是“黄金世代”的其中一人，\n因此大家都很期待她的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0d525e9df11cad976dacf3cd18f5146ca72a81789562ae1b9fe95174079007",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c4299bce2425d68cd2917b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她拥有强烈的意志，为了胜利，\n不管几次她都会重新站起继续挑战……\n但她高傲的言行举止，也将周围耍得团团转。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e80f58ac0f8f2caa0b057422ff004cd126c5ef2509357eeb35c10176b1119e88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21b4b97a00f78368a952565",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与这样的任性千金一起，\n以闪耀系列赛为目标，\n充满挑战性的日子开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8a8de81a6cfcc6c640e9bf5dcf641a1fa7208598e02864222c6f3de4611dca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4a4c7a12919b37d8a7010e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1aa21e187cf9eedd14fc321be203f5c921e7e543369411a0e3c44e6d0695d36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb732f42a3e796c6e1e057f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我的名字是～？”“圣王！”\n……训练员被迫跟着难解的自我介绍打call。\n任性千金可说是状况绝佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa582dfe0795c36e67d2799952c899a16b821eef500887a3fec458f89fb859e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a88d19de335198e7b43df985",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在训练中一样任性妄为，\n还把记者叫来要他们采访自己，\n这时气槽跳出来指责她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae9f388642b408f685a29b15e6bcdf12eb819a32bba0202e7789a94c30b5323",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f268752356e1b434019d29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人同为母亲曾活跃于赛场的赛马娘……\n为此气槽对她提出了忠告。\n然而，圣王光环却充耳不闻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b323ff4104f9f623fe11de740585402788bc30adcc7c5f1daecc44bb97ae9e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8831f870f69488d68f6594c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为她说自己有着要让那些人――\n让把自己视为“千金小姐”的世人，\n与断定自己没有才能的母亲认可自己的义务。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2f87c099a469f58f0ce7a6362d3c5c2ec2fb72c061178d7af22cbd0dc34ea3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45078b8c37651097c79285be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追逐，被追逐",
      "source_fingerprint": "43999606da84947bcbeb12c469c2e99f6c8797f9078b89e10a3d97bf2cdba4a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edfcb6e7c25bc612fe749799",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结束出道战后，圣王光环与同伴们\n一起热闹地度过午餐时间，\n但此时话题谈到杂志的“黄金世代”特辑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc69bea1bbd68f5a7cc9a50f76bf749e34261717fe4126d132f5d4f1d709755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2509d053b0d5f10147cf89e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来和谐的午餐气氛一下就紧张了起来。\n谁会成为这世代的主角呢？\n战斗已经开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8969b9b8a6e36c50fb2680509e934cd9385993fcc033cb8de3c8be68b1985ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea40fdf4a0e81c4d9525bde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时，川上公主突然热烈声援圣王光环。\n她在看了那篇报导后，\n就成为圣王光环的粉丝了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d84251765cf6ed091c9e5a838bb22d03995b485a3bc881da5754305f08b07bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:330e93b51c367cee64054e85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环虽然惊讶于她旋风般的气势，\n但同时也绷紧了神经！\n发誓除了川上之外也要让全世界都认可自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "964fd26846d4362a102464daca05ff58ddfa557cc027e7e03a659574b74acbdc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:671d914de139d22472b2f5c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们出道了",
      "source_fingerprint": "680e552863ea40de8b867c81594cf615451a0cdb266201d70567c6764f1d30f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be50e3b10dd9a9fcc5c4df1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周在“菊花赏”上的对手，\n只有青云天空一个──\n这样的共识普遍存在于媒体与大众之间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8e533e4e5505c464fb85af292899047bd2e9563d1713c30af43a5461e6cddf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d8d1835ae8e64ae2a88dad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，对于圣王光环的表现，\n训练员确定了一件事。\n她……适合跑短距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "698db8aa2c5fd84e667f41ebc9e4e9d87d4dcff20894308ea271ed0f5ff6c29b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98032a88b58eb9b649d5d95a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到底跑长距离的“菊花赏”是否正确呢？\n训练员表达了这个疑虑后，\n圣王光环静静地点了点头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9d2b97b770d28e9cc59215cb0b5d4b45a42c241d78d562f944f2f8ee8f4ec2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f46e29205efaa9e0b21ee6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我是一流的赛马娘。要得到认可，\n就必须在正统的经典三冠路线上表现优异。”\n她以被逼到绝境的表情如是说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee64fc2225039a0c4751d991f3989a497667bfe55dc772a331060feaa50dc636",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27967227be09f72e05f8e681",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的脚",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6e117017831d6c7c82b99751f1174edd0c424b2aa59c13f1d9a593b26bd2dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03842d7214efe3e39b5c9868",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”后过了几天，圣王光环\n怀抱着某个决心并身穿决胜服出现在赛场。\n“我的名字是～？”“圣王～！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "671cf74bf2c131691d2a1b59ae30632e8199955a9d33436b897f355e5ffac0bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41a3db378302caca53b7e9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……并伴随着难解的自我介绍打call。\n媒体也都喜孜孜地要采访她突发的行动。\n然而这些都在圣王光环的料想之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02417b387fecab539e95dc2afe1ae1468d7062d8a10da4f28b4ef7c16fa1488",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb821f8077e613b498772c57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环宣布接下来将前进“高松宫纪念”。\n同时她也祈祷着这事被写成报导后，\n人们的注意力会再次转向她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca44ce345843c3a0583482e3fa924a3e6329a2d1a7b3f42a15ef81d29a75027",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99943ded07242fa89ac91cb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次，任性千金表达了她新的决心，\n她不会放弃，要走上不属于母亲，\n也不属于其他人的“只属于她的道路”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fc6e0b1ff991103d7637d2eef83f4c52bf17b636623cc6ff16196f397bb627",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0390a259fa5f4634c7350ee5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一流的决心",
      "source_fingerprint": "461d5818577081eba39bc282ce704ca8917ed28b584401d247870bc7aa568d99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b579ecba2cea0f09d5bf2b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自“天皇赏（秋）”结束后过了数个礼拜。\n离圣王光环宣示她会走上自己的路那天，\n也已经一年了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ca3f43dd3d26e9226b5b39dc66fbe2304b1a3a4a0e94ff0fc63b137dbbdc19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f9447597f78bd069e61cfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环现在也一样任性，\n总是想以一流赛马娘的身份受到瞩目！\n果然该参加“有马纪念”吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c36f98e7b800801f08d784ccfde40cd065702a073699781d39dab6ca685dd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b023470a779fef4ac4ff62bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回程路上，她忽然提到荣誉赛马娘的话题。\n说是她的母亲曾经提过想亲手\n替未来的URA荣誉赛马娘制作决胜服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f338df963f41fd8c6a456f35cf950d4c02a03b89ee2e7ad54f443f788273c2bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38eae98b1bd829e03b8353d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“但是，那种表现不过是必经之路罢了！\n而且我一辈子都不会退役！”\n看来圣王光环的路仍会持续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9449563c2eeea3cb07ea06883642af683eb90645ab58ec97e5e6836047923e13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03532c8a39e72a7eff30b10e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "关注的前方",
      "source_fingerprint": "101a30d93d5d593bc8753880f9b8edcfea3c07a48f1c2d590cd8e648bc4bebba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a893f6aeef31edf898a23c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环的“夏季集训”开始了！\n“这里将以‘圣王成长之地’闻名于世！”\n虽然她夸下如此海口，却被炎热打败了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a74c7f50143db30031bb6c5fd6704c72b67f83676cae8a6f7bc007010b3a272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc464b80efcfc365e2788fc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“总有一天我会在设施里加装冷气的……”\n她说出了如此小小的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af28ddbf7400aaa62647e36c61156568d70c7ce93c61b8024e6f7347496377d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb96250bab0efeb9c6c2e57a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56370c7c5051970c79c6aea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训的时期再次到来。去年这时候，\n我们正在为经典三冠路线努力，\n而现在我们走在只属于圣王光环的道路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b313d58acdf47b762a25722663ff4456fb9a11b8d1229a785b08bc9769488283",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dfb1f9e10af2adfb3678fc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时，特别周向她询问\n“你下次要参加哪场比赛？”\n但说到一半就被打断，两人约好以后再来谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a218b8b8fcd23ed53b90e5be794a91fff72861d04da4ac8f042951c0661b9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36ea2cde0bdb0c37106269d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为各自走上了不同的道路，\n才诞生了新的发现与新的热情吗？\n――无论如何，她们都是劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e65d4a936ff85177793867345e9210edcfba5f4bb3ddb88a83594778eca460",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24796425c3a70ee7171be101",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faf8b8ccf28eacf3b4057860",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了期待已久的出道战，\n“抢先第一个出道的人是我哦！”\n圣王光环高声笑着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "608d7cea0428e2210942210d3097271772f3aa73183e7d73726b4144c4f1bae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bada12b8797f9ed0936ec3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……就在这时，从休息室的电视里，\n传出了对几天前出道的草上飞她那\n出色表现大肆赞扬的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f604686087ecba1c5d840fcf8d03cb401d4643525f12c6cdb9c791c0a07c3cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86399702f9be49fdef4c7647",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环，无法抢先第一个出道。\n……不过，只要有好结果足矣。\n来吧，出道战开跑了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c556df1039bc5387b58914a9679612e7120b5387f57d69cd9d623bda282fa08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e503e1e4ffc185381a85be6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ee4e339f88465996188a0b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定新马级冠军的舞台之一，\nGⅠ竞赛“希望锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce8addbf6dc804b2b2727476da36acf881afa6209654d2b547f82be45dfa060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dadf267bfb751aaa1b236412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这不过是必经阶段罢了。\n因此得展现出华丽又美丽的最佳表现──\n圣王光环说出了她对胜利的渴望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d836d36030ef2b8134f7ff92425ea682bbcfff152a9385edeb1a66864d538665",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf58fc9046cb308d08f43a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向希望S",
      "source_fingerprint": "adb373f200cb49f40c02297528eb2737067be5c594bb1c8cfce7e8afaa072465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4375151f6d6f87bdfb1bf23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠路线的“皋月赏”终于开幕，\n圣王光环也迎向了这场首战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c67dd7bee2af43866f72a5ef340f2f82e29e618ca949e300f0523224d62c3b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db235cf3a55918e9b37383c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在亮相圈登场的圣王光环，\n与同样要跑这场比赛的\n青云天空交谈了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5961396f2ec6ba7afd4957464bb3508c90828fbb9d52ed61fc03f72ac4af83db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a51f65e24b67ce5b5df30f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青云天空虽然表现轻浮，\n但她的状态其实调整得相当完美。\n圣王光环对这个事实心知肚明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d9ef98216ec875152da0afb8f054b67baa2d60428e66c749ce75503d9e6124",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:248831f147ad7022621b9031",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这情况下，她表示“我需要成果”，\n并表露出对胜利的执着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b25e35167fefb6f98274e9abbca67274097687c90ab1e85db21d3cdddc6dacb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061410.json",
      "json_path": [
