    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f7c6b8677140cb55bb6dbe7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向皋月赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff224a61598a6c666007568d7268968b6f324292cc2eee89e3b5acc428c30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5aff523739c008aeb08a18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠路线的第二战开幕了，\n圣王光环怀抱必胜的决心，\n迎向“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f747b51bcde04aa2f008fd338d5a18e7f5721b0da8ea1a164b45eff599aad09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167f6037cdaa1104145f3132",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但比她抢先一步，\n在亮相圈获得巨大欢呼的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5581439aa7e985b7bbcfbe95b29cd25c5950269e0046d0bdcfb89d1d85b90c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877b6cd020ebba2ed00bb092",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是威风凛凛地宣示，\n要为了母亲成为日本第一的特别周。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3cc8ad380641967e59a5c2da558b50ba442cc646e672a37d6dad2332cc9154e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:addd5fdefa7f23cbdaf394a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8676f4159ec917a2232d3cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为经典三冠路线画上句号的“菊花赏”。\n观众们都将期待放在\n特别周与青云天空两人身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc91102c1bf168b55aef36263fb2cc8440a0b2f74b5479e194dbd0927461df12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff81e94920de9e7b948c1123",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明真正的主角不是她们……\n圣王光环一边抱怨，\n一边朝亮相圈前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa1ee0c26190e8b3519e916bc3b012403f590d6af14f926d0d2594b1fec987c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceb824d548c84f0104386d28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a68bf012f6f16a32cf75d4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来的话，锁定经典三冠路线的赛马娘，\n一般来说都会选择中长距离的比赛才是。\n然而，圣王光环却不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35b253dd862504bfac860b02c2a78a4962ca54d36de8408801b56a1dc3defac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeba2feb0210df94d2a1adb8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了走上属于自己的一流之道，\n她选了决定短距离王者的“高松宫纪念”。\n即使这是个错误的选择也不会后悔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c33d0e00552923235846a3b4dbc723d967cf4b5973a556feebd60af72912452b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07e119e89b4eb7ca5b4dc13f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然训练员也有所觉悟了。\n若失败就从头开始努力吧──\n他们两人确认了彼此的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade2b4a48612399d8d8c092be1863096d6371f35193e09e4fb2309cdc4bda81c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:634e20a66977bcb774c6e655",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向高松宫纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd48b5001601f12157246835633bea4d4d81960d6f90ef64147191b38f0166e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2cab76a17179b0d09381f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会场中所有人都在讨论要出赛的赛马娘。\n最近轰动媒体的有趣名媛……\n圣王光环也不例外地成为焦点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1249380fe523fcd3f32bd8a89ff473eae460ff0f14bbab247c7b9f89bfe33ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb3a530fa37b41e3ca6f040",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "镜头转到“安田纪念”参赛者休息室。\n圣王光环夸下海口，\n不管对手是谁都没关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91816a16eebc5804996d230b015c407e6ecbdc32a03a009437c218f017aff80a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f324ae5b21d278c3fbac3555",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我的道路上不需要碍事者。\n我会用这双脚把所有人都踢翻！”\n她斗志昂扬地参加了比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71eccf63cdf320df34f9d373a366d63dbc14b5f11eaabbd042c5039c50a7aae5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ed453fe0fcedaa89de35ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向安田纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "40faa17dcdcc78010dfdb54e170136a09461b2a4f83f216658d669031f8da30e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c050135141664446098287b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到了“短途马锦标”当天。\n看到自己的海报被大大地贴在广告看板上，\n圣王光环得意地高声大笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4501ac65572814a5f400c3d20b6855638f6d40d50e868900af27add3eb52be59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9cb1b4fce0b22c7d3263ca9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使被知道她进入会场的记者们发现，\n她也从容不迫地一边回应粉丝的加油声，\n一边前往休息室。她确实是越来越受欢迎了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "458481e52d06303eb49f64824cd2c6081c8ab0a1384025bc4f0b7f174f806686",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd5c54593e911392f559d02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最受瞩目的就是这位赛马娘吗。\n称霸了春季电击战的女王，不，圣王！”\n这场秋季短距离王决定战的主角毫无疑问──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc4d5098f674d6cb1ba84ce5a16a0b711ef7df4b96289456939d2fce67df4a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a356fe3abe958c2fa8decf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有圣王光环一人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8ed7f650600770433144f860f17218efbf116447da65224d36f9c16bb36ca10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a394b8c820ad087da10d7df8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向短途马S",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bab545f7924d8721b7b9078079534e50dece19c3a4014f3da27a75d093b542f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5cec19d3b5f5aefd04151f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赌上历史悠久的秋季奖牌，\n经典级、古马级赛马娘齐聚一堂，\n一年一度的大舞台──“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094226010eac04ccfe94afa6ddbf01b68255476f1ee6afa305f2b62e0ef6203d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9475a0e5fe016d5ca10478a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想必在这个瞬间，\n这里对站在亮相圈的她们而言，\n是别具意义的舞台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44643647271bcaca9bbeec21831073fa3ab146a03039a79e35790cb18c8b939b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54436e0a3b938ed0008d317",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环。\n特别周。\n青云天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc7b63be2c217a7b915b513c8ed548a808b904f435f918fcb3548dda1c4b46a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
